unty runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle saw June to July at 166% of normal and August to September at 65%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 48% of normal and May to June at 161%. Grids 22974 and 22975 had their driest year in 1976 at 67%.</p>"}
